t-viewport","unity-scroll-view__content-viewport--vertical"]},{"name":"unity-content-container","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[42,380,368,636],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-scroll-view__content-container","unity-scroll-view__content-container--vertical"]},{"name":"log","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":"Field Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d71, Copper Filament \u00d71, Micro Capacitor \u00d71, Intact Actuator \u00d71\nOuter Berms: You go down in the dust. A Warden patrol drags you back to the post.\nSystem: Scrap pistol drawn. Hold right mouse to aim.\nField Pack: Collected: Foreman Control Core \u00d71, Intact Actuator \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d72, Nanite Residue \u00d75, Micro Capacitor \u00d72 Schematics discovered: Gyro-Braced Grip, Lattice-Focused Barrel, Overclocked Charge Cell.\nWarden Ossa: That core still holds its shift schedules, and Mark II pistol schematics with them. They're in the fabricator now. Reward: 40 credits.\nWarden Ossa: Mark II work needs rare parts: intact actuators and quantum lattice shards. The foreman carries both, and its charging cradle keeps reviving it. Build me something Warden-grade.\nField Fabricator: Refined Alloy Plate fabricated.\nField Fabricator: Refined Alloy Plate fabricated.\nField Fabricator: Gyro-Braced Grip fabricated. Fit it to your pistol.\nWarden Ossa: That's Warden-grade work. The Berms are yours to hunt now; the depot always fills up again. Reward: 50 credits.\nField Fabricator: Gyro-Braced Grip fitted. Recoil 31 \u2192 23 \u00b7 Aim assist 3.5\u00b0 \u2192 4.5\u00b0\nField Fabricator: Salvaged Capacitor Cell returned to your pack.\nField Fabricator: Salvaged Capacitor Cell fitted. Nano capacity 100 \u2192 135 \u00b7 Nano refill 30/s \u2192 34.5/s\nSystem: Scrap pistol holstered.\nMira: Welcome to Basic General. Fresh seals on the flasks, checked packs in the medkits. I can buy that scrap coil if you need a few credits.\nYou: Show me your stock.","bounds":[42,380,368,636],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element"]},{"name":"unity-slider","type":"ScrollerSlider","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider--vertical","unity-base-field","unity-base-slider","unity-scroller__slider","unity-slider","unity-base-field--no-label"]},{"name":"unity-drag-container","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__drag-container"]},{"name":"unity-tracker","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[416,943,24,49],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__tracker"]},{"name":"unity-dragger","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[419,985,18,7],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-base-slider__dragger"]},{"name":"chat-footer","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[42,1021,386,27],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["chat-footer"]},{"name":"","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":"Local transmissions","bounds":[73,1032,116,15],"fontSize":16.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element","muted","small"]},{"name":"quickbar","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[616,970,688,90],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["movable-window"]},{"name":"hotbar","type":"VisualElement","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[616,970,688,90],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["panel"]},{"name":"slot1","type":"Button","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":"","bounds":[629,988,64,64],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-button","unity-text-element","hotbar-slot"]},{"name":"","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":"1","bounds":[632,991,16,18],"fontSize":14.0,"classes":["unity-label","unity-text-element","keycap"]},{"name":"","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":f